<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SourceNet Partners — Nearshore Staffing for Staffing Agencies</title>
<meta name="description" content="SourceNet Partners builds nearshore teams in Bolivia for U.S. staffing agencies — recruiters, sourcers, sales support, admin, and back office, within an hour of your time zone.">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --navy:#081E33;
    --navy-2:#0F2A47;
    --blue:#175EB1;
    --blue-light:#2E7BDB;
    --gold:#C89B3C;
    --bg:#F7F9FC;
    --white:#FFFFFF;
    --slate:#5B6B7F;
    --border:#E2E8F0;
    --radius:14px;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    color:var(--navy);
    background:var(--bg);
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.02em;}
  .mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;}
  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;}
  section{padding:96px 0;}
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:0.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--blue);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{
    content:"";
    width:22px;height:2px;
    background:var(--gold);
    display:inline-block;
  }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation-duration:0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important; transition-duration:0.01ms !important;}
  }
  :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue); outline-offset:3px;}

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  header{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:100;
    background:rgba(247,249,252,0.86);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  nav{
    max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:16px 32px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
  }
  .brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;}
  .brand img{height:34px; width:auto;}
  .brand-text{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:17px; color:var(--navy); line-height:1.1;}
  .brand-text span{display:block; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-weight:500; font-size:9px; letter-spacing:0.18em; color:var(--slate); margin-top:2px;}
  .nav-links{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:34px;}
  .nav-links a{
    font-size:14.5px; font-weight:500; color:var(--navy-2);
    position:relative; padding:4px 0;
  }
  .nav-links a::after{
    content:""; position:absolute; left:0; bottom:0; width:0; height:2px;
    background:var(--blue); transition:width 0.2s ease;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover::after{width:100%;}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    padding:12px 22px; border-radius:999px;
    font-size:14.5px; font-weight:600;
    border:1.5px solid transparent;
    cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.2s ease;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .btn-primary{background:var(--navy); color:#fff;}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--blue); transform:translateY(-1px);}
  .btn-outline{border-color:var(--navy); color:var(--navy); background:transparent;}
  .btn-outline:hover{background:var(--navy); color:#fff;}
  .hamburger{display:none; flex-direction:column; gap:5px; background:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; padding:6px;}
  .hamburger span{width:22px; height:2px; background:var(--navy); display:block;}

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{padding:88px 0 70px;}
  .hero-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.05fr 0.95fr; gap:64px; align-items:center;}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,4.4vw,54px); font-weight:700; line-height:1.08; color:var(--navy);}
  .hero h1 em{font-style:normal; color:var(--blue);}
  .hero p.lead{font-size:18px; color:var(--slate); margin-top:22px; max-width:490px;}
  .hero-cta{display:flex; gap:14px; margin-top:34px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .hero-stats{display:flex; gap:36px; margin-top:52px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .hero-stat b{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-size:26px; display:block; color:var(--navy);}
  .hero-stat span{font-size:13px; color:var(--slate);}

  /* Time zone bridge widget */
  .bridge{
    background:var(--navy);
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:34px 30px 30px;
    color:#fff;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .bridge::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background:radial-gradient(circle at 85% -10%, rgba(23,94,177,0.45), transparent 55%);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .bridge-label{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#9FB6D4; margin-bottom:22px;}
  .clocks{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; position:relative; z-index:1;}
  .clock-col{text-align:center; flex:1;}
  .clock-city{font-size:13px; color:#C7D6E8; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .clock-time{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:30px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.01em;}
  .clock-flag{font-size:11px; color:#7C93B0; margin-top:6px; letter-spacing:0.06em;}
  .bridge-line{
    flex:0 0 auto; width:64px; height:2px; margin:0 6px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue-light), var(--gold));
    position:relative; top:-14px;
  }
  .bridge-line::after{
    content:""; position:absolute; right:-3px; top:-3px;
    width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--gold);
    box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(200,155,60,0.22);
  }
  .bridge-diff{
    margin-top:26px; padding-top:22px; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:space-between; position:relative; z-index:1;
  }
  .bridge-diff .num{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-size:19px; font-weight:700; color:var(--gold);}
  .bridge-diff .txt{font-size:13px; color:#C7D6E8; max-width:230px; text-align:right;}

  /* ---------- SECTION HEADERS ---------- */
  .sec-head{max-width:640px; margin-bottom:56px;}
  .sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,38px); font-weight:700; color:var(--navy);}
  .sec-head p{font-size:16.5px; color:var(--slate); margin-top:14px;}

  /* ---------- WHY (cost/quality) ---------- */
  .why{background:var(--white); border-top:1px solid var(--border); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
  .why-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:28px;}
  .why-card{
    background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:36px 32px;
  }
  .why-card .icon{
    width:46px; height:46px; border-radius:12px; background:var(--navy);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .why-card h3{font-size:21px; margin-bottom:12px;}
  .why-card p{color:var(--slate); font-size:15px;}
  .why-card ul{margin-top:18px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;}
  .why-card li{font-size:14.5px; color:var(--navy-2); display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;}
  .why-card li::before{content:"—"; color:var(--gold); font-weight:700; flex:none;}

  /* ---------- ROLES ---------- */
  .roles-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:22px;}
  .role-card{
    background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:28px 26px; transition:transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .role-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px); box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(8,30,51,0.08); border-color:var(--blue);}
  .role-card .tag{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--blue); margin-bottom:14px; display:block;
  }
  .role-card h3{font-size:18.5px; margin-bottom:10px;}
  .role-card p{font-size:14px; color:var(--slate);}

  /* ---------- HOW IT WORKS ---------- */
  .how{background:var(--navy); color:#fff;}
  .how .sec-head h2, .how .eyebrow{color:#fff;}
  .how .sec-head p{color:#AFC1D9;}
  .how .eyebrow{color:var(--gold);}
  .how .eyebrow::before{background:var(--blue-light);}
  .steps{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr); gap:18px;}
  .step{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    border-radius:var(--radius); padding:26px 20px; position:relative;
  }
  .step .n{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:var(--gold); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:16px;}
  .step h4{font-size:15.5px; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.3;}
  .step p{font-size:13px; color:#B7C6DB;}

  /* ---------- WHY BOLIVIA ---------- */
  .bolivia-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.15fr; gap:56px; align-items:center;}
  .bolivia-photo{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.35fr 1fr; grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;
    gap:10px; height:440px;
  }
  .collage-main{grid-row:1 / 3; position:relative; border-radius:18px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(8,30,51,0.14);}
  .collage-sub{position:relative; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 12px 24px rgba(8,30,51,0.12);}
  .bolivia-photo img{width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block; filter:saturate(0.92) contrast(1.03);}
  .collage-main::after, .collage-sub::after{
    content:""; position:absolute; inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8,30,51,0) 55%, rgba(8,30,51,0.72) 100%);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .photo-credit{
    position:absolute; left:14px; bottom:12px; z-index:1;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:0.05em;
    color:#fff; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px;
  }
  .collage-main .photo-credit{font-size:12.5px; left:20px; bottom:16px;}
  .photo-credit::before{content:""; width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--gold); display:inline-block; flex:none;}
  .bolivia-text{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:36px;}
  .bolivia-stats{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:18px;}
  .photo-attribution{font-size:10.5px; color:#9AA7B5; order:-1;}
  .photo-attribution a{color:#9AA7B5; text-decoration:underline;}
  .bstat{background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:24px 22px;}
  .bstat b{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-size:28px; color:var(--navy); display:block;}
  .bstat span{font-size:13px; color:var(--slate);}
  .bolivia-copy h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px); margin-bottom:18px;}
  .bolivia-copy p{color:var(--slate); font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;}
  .bolivia-copy .flagline{
    display:inline-flex; gap:4px; margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .flagline span{width:26px; height:6px; border-radius:2px;}

  /* ---------- CTA / CONTACT ---------- */
  .cta-section{background:var(--white); border-top:1px solid var(--border);}
  .cta-panel{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--navy-2) 100%);
    border-radius:24px; padding:56px; color:#fff;
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:50px; align-items:start;
    position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .cta-panel::after{
    content:""; position:absolute; right:-80px; top:-80px; width:280px; height:280px;
    background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(200,155,60,0.25), transparent 70%);
  }
  .cta-copy{position:relative; z-index:1;}
  .cta-copy h2{font-size:clamp(24px,2.8vw,32px); margin-bottom:16px;}
  .cta-copy p{color:#B7C6DB; font-size:15.5px; margin-bottom:26px;}
  .cta-contact-line{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-size:14.5px; margin-bottom:12px; color:#DCE6F2;}
  form.request-form{position:relative; z-index:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;}
  .form-row{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px;}
  .request-form input, .request-form select, .request-form textarea{
    width:100%; padding:13px 15px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.07); color:#fff; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; font-size:14.5px;
  }
  .request-form ::placeholder{color:#93A6C0;}
  .request-form label{font-size:12.5px; color:#AFC1D9; margin-bottom:-6px;}
  .request-form textarea{resize:vertical; min-height:80px;}
  .request-form button{
    margin-top:6px; background:var(--gold); color:var(--navy); border:none;
    padding:14px 22px; border-radius:10px; font-weight:700; font-size:15px; cursor:pointer;
    transition:background 0.2s ease;
  }
  .request-form button:hover{background:#DCAF52;}
  .form-note{font-size:12px; color:#8FA3BE; margin-top:2px;}

  /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
  footer{background:var(--navy); color:#B7C6DB; padding:50px 0 30px;}
  .footer-grid{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:30px; padding-bottom:34px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);}
  .footer-brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;}
  .footer-brand img{height:28px; filter:brightness(0) invert(1);}
  .footer-brand-text{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-weight:700; color:#fff; font-size:15px;}
  .footer-links{display:flex; gap:40px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .footer-links div{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;}
  .footer-links h5{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#7C93B0; margin-bottom:4px;}
  .footer-links a{font-size:14px;}
  .footer-links a:hover{color:#fff;}
  .footer-bottom{padding-top:24px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:12.5px; color:#7C93B0; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px;}

  /* ---------- RESPONSIVE ---------- */
  @media(max-width:980px){
    .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:44px;}
    .why-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .roles-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
    .steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
    .bolivia-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .bolivia-photo{height:320px;}
    .cta-panel{grid-template-columns:1fr; padding:36px 26px;}
  }
  @media(max-width:720px){
    .nav-links{position:fixed; top:66px; left:0; right:0; background:var(--bg); flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; padding:20px 32px; gap:18px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); transform:translateY(-130%); transition:transform 0.25s ease; z-index:99;}
    .nav-links.open{transform:translateY(0);}
    .hamburger{display:flex;}
    section{padding:64px 0;}
    .roles-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .hero-stats{gap:24px;}
    .footer-links{gap:26px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <nav>
    <a href="#home" class="brand">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="SourceNet Partners">
      <span class="brand-text">SourceNet Partners<span>NEARSHORE STAFFING</span></span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#why">Why Nearshore</a>
      <a href="#roles">Roles We Staff</a>
      <a href="#how">How It Works</a>
      <a href="#bolivia">Why Bolivia</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Request Staff</a>
    </div>
    <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Nearshore staffing built for staffing agencies</div>
      <h1>Grow your agency without growing your overhead.<br></h1>
      <p class="lead">SourceNet Partners places vetted, English-fluent talent in Bolivia into recruiter, sales support, and admin roles for U.S. staffing agencies — at a fraction of domestic cost, inside your working day.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Request Staff</a>
        <a href="#roles" class="btn btn-outline">See the Roles</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="hero-stat"><b>60–70%</b><span>Lower cost than<br>U.S. hires</span></div>
        <div class="hero-stat"><b>&lt;1 hr</b><span>Time zone gap<br>with the U.S.</span></div>
        <div class="hero-stat"><b>2 wks</b><span>Typical time<br>to placement</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bridge">
      <div class="bridge-label">Live overlap — your day, their day</div>
      <div class="clocks">
        <div class="clock-col">
          <div class="clock-city">U.S. Eastern Time</div>
          <div class="clock-time mono" id="clockUS">--:--</div>
          <div class="clock-flag">UTC-4/5</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bridge-line"></div>
        <div class="clock-col">
          <div class="clock-city">Bolivia</div>
          <div class="clock-time mono" id="clockBO">--:--</div>
          <div class="clock-flag">BOLIVIA TIME</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bridge-diff">
        <div><span class="num" id="diffLabel">—</span></div>
        <div class="txt">apart from Eastern Time — your Bolivia team works the same business day you do, no graveyard shifts.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="why" id="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Why agencies switch to nearshore</div>
      <h2>Cut cost without cutting quality</h2>
      <p>Domestic recruiter and admin salaries are the single biggest line item on most agency P&Ls. Nearshore in Bolivia changes that math — without the trade-offs agencies worry about with offshore.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2V22M17 5.5H9.5C7.6 5.5 6 7.1 6 9C6 10.9 7.6 12.5 9.5 12.5H14.5C16.4 12.5 18 14.1 18 16C18 17.9 16.4 19.5 14.5 19.5H6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Real cost savings</h3>
        <p>Fully-loaded nearshore staff in Bolivia typically run 60–70% less than the equivalent U.S. hire — before you factor in payroll tax, benefits, and turnover cost.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>No recruiting fees, no benefits admin, no payroll tax exposure on your end</li>
          <li>Month-to-month flexibility — scale a role up or down as your book of business shifts</li>
          <li>One flat rate per seat, so budgeting is predictable quarter to quarter</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 12L11 14L15 10M12 3L4 6.5V11.5C4 16.2 7.4 20.6 12 22C16.6 20.6 20 16.2 20 11.5V6.5L12 3Z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Talent, not just labor</h3>
        <p>We recruit for staffing agencies the same way we'd recruit for any client — with a bar for communication, ownership, and follow-through, not just a resume that checks boxes.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Every candidate is screened live on English fluency, phone presence, and tool fluency (ATS, CRM, dialers)</li>
          <li>Bolivia's talent pool skews young, credentialed, and hungry for remote U.S. roles</li>
          <li>You interview and approve every hire before they touch your pipeline</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="roles">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Built for agency operations</div>
      <h2>Roles we staff for staffing companies</h2>
      <p>We focus on the high-volume, high-leverage roles that keep an agency's pipeline moving — not management. You keep strategic and client-facing leadership in-house; we staff the engine underneath it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="roles-grid">
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="tag">Recruiting</span>
        <h3>Recruiters &amp; Sourcers</h3>
        <p>Full-desk sourcing, resume screening, first-round phone screens, and pipeline building across your open reqs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="tag">Sales</span>
        <h3>Sales Support &amp; BDRs</h3>
        <p>Lead list building, cold outreach, appointment setting, and CRM upkeep to keep your business development team fed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="tag">Admin</span>
        <h3>Admin &amp; Back Office</h3>
        <p>Scheduling, onboarding paperwork, timesheet processing, and general inbox and calendar management.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="tag">Support</span>
        <h3>Appointment Setters</h3>
        <p>Outbound and inbound scheduling for client meetings, candidate interviews, and follow-up calls.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="tag">Ops</span>
        <h3>Virtual Assistants</h3>
